$DIR/main.p:9:2: defer of builtin len is not supported
    This builtin cannot be deferred directly. Wrap the call in a function
    literal and defer that.
    Defer a function literal:
        defer func() { n = len(s) }()
    (see "Defer statements" in the Plutonium spec, section 12.19)
